    <http://example.org/node/chunk200> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Identify key stakeholders and key stakeholders expectations. 2. **Design phase**: Develop a detailed design of the solution, including technical architecture and change management plans. 3. **Pilot phase**: Implement the solution in one or two departments, with focused training and support for staff. 4. **Generalisation phase**: Progressively roll out the solution to all services, with ongoing monitoring and evaluation. 5. **Run phase**: Ensure the solution is fully operational, with continuous improvement and maintenance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk201> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Decision points will include: 1." ;
