        ex:hasText "Review of generalisation phase progress and adjustment of plans as needed By following Our hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, maintaining a strong governance structure, and tracking key milestones and decision points, Faber IA can ensure successful project delivery and meet the client's expectations for progressive deployment, change management, and staff training." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk206> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We propose an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients. an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients will provide intelligent assistance tools accessible from hospital staff work environment, supporting hospital staff in clinical-administrative activities. an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients utilizes We Atelier platform, integrating our Atelier platform with the client's existing SIH and DPI systems through APIs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk207> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We will leverage We model-agnostic approach to deploy models that can assist in drafting medical documents and provide information retrieval functionalities. an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients will be hosted on OuraneCloud's Sovereign HDS tier, ensuring compliance with French HDS certification and SecNumCloud qualifications. an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients ensures strict compliance with GDPR, processing health data as special-category data (GDPR Art. 9) and preserving medical confidentiality." ;
