        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk209> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sensitive data will be protected using encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant. an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients provides functionality for retrieval of information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulation, as well as assistance in drafting medical and administrative documents. an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients supports handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, designed to improve efficiency and quality of care delivered to patients also takes into account the dossier context where available and does not automate clinical or medico-administrative decisions without explicit validation by a qualified professional. our model-agnostic approach is grounded in the organization's own validated documents, limiting unsupported generation and ensuring answers are based on internal procedures, care protocols, applicable regulatory texts, and other relevant sources." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

